      "text": "Black Rock Mountain State Park"
    },
    {
      "id": "83489b1",
      "container": "f1d39f2",
      "type": "text-editor",
      "html": "<p>Georgia’s highest state park encompasses some of the most outstanding scenery in Georgia’s Blue Ridge Mountains. <a href=\"https://gastateparks.org/BlackRockMountain\"><span><strong>Click here for more info.</strong></span></a></p>"
    },
