      "type": "heading",
      "tag": "h2",
      "text": "Tallulah Gorge and State Park"
    },
    {
      "id": "8851527",
      "container": "ff08f71",
      "type": "text-editor",
      "html": "<p>Tallulah Gorge is one of the most spectacular canyons in the eastern U.S., Tallulah Gorge is two miles long and nearly 1,000 feet deep. Visitors can hike rim trails to several overlooks,<a href=\"https://gastateparks.org/TallulahGorge\"><span><strong> Click here for more info.</strong></span></a></p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "acdbb4d",
